WEBVTT

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:00.011
and control our bodies.

00:01:00.011 --> 00:01:03.273
This spindly structure makes 
them very fragile

00:01:03.273 --> 00:01:08.631
so that when impacted, neurons
will stretch and even tear.

00:01:08.631 --> 00:01:11.271
That not only disrupts their ability
to communicate

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:14.792
but as destroyed axons begin
to degenerate,

00:01:14.792 --> 00:01:20.759
they also release toxins
causing the death of other neurons, too.

00:01:20.759 --> 00:01:24.462
This combination of events causes
a concussion.

00:01:24.462 --> 00:01:26.952
The damage can manifest 
in many different ways

00:01:26.952 --> 00:01:28.382
including blackout,

00:01:28.382 --> 00:01:29.243
headache,

00:01:29.243 --> 00:01:30.373
blurry vision,